NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The trained model weights (backend/best.pt) and the image dataset (dataset/) are
NOT covered by this licence and are NOT redistributable. See the "Data licensing"
section of README.md: the largest upstream source declares no licence at all, and
two further sources are non-commercial with share-alike obligations.

ultralytics/yolov5 is a third-party dependency licensed AGPL-3.0; the vendored
clone under yolov5/ retains that licence. See yolov5/LICENSE.
